2 CONT ----
2 CONT Josephine von Baroni-Cavalcabò (Castiglioni) (1787 -1860) was a partner, a mistress of [https://www.geni.com/people/Wolfgang-Mozart/6000000002454309450 '''Mozart''']'s son [https://www.geni.com/people/Franz-Mozart/6000000002149446
2 CONC 480 '''Franz Xaver Wolfgang Mozart'''], they were not married.<br/>
2 CONT She was married to [https://www.geni.com/people/Ludwig-von-Baroni-Cavalcab%C3%B2/6000000096980031982 '''Ludwig Cajetan von Baroni-Cavalcabò''']. 
2 CONT --------------------
